# --- Course submission / experiment artifacts ---
# These were previously ignored to keep the repo light, but for the final
# project submission we want to version experiment outputs (traces, checkpoints,
# learned domains, KB/transition logs, and the temporally filtered wiki graph).
#
# If this repo is later used as a lightweight dev repo again, consider reverting
# this section or moving large artifacts to a release/archive.

# Track experiment outputs
